> and adapt if needed)
. 
.         * Extract the required statistics
. 
.                 * (i) coefficient estimate
.                 estimates replay m1

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model m1
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Treatment-effects estimation                   Number of obs      =        381
Estimator      : propensity-score matching     Matches: requested =          1
Outcome model  : matching                                     min =          1
Treatment model: probit                                       max =          1
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
             |              AI robust
gender_sha~k | Coefficient  std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
ATET         |
    daughter |
   (1 vs 0)  |  -.2930403   .2843446    -1.03   0.303    -.8503454    .2642648
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

.                 mat coef_men=r(table)

.                 scalar N_men = e(N)

.                 
.                 estimates replay m2

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model m2
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Treatment-effects estimation                   Number of obs      =        469
Estimator      : propensity-score matching     Matches: requested =          1
Outcome model  : matching                                     min =          1
Treatment model: probit                                       max =          1
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
             |              AI robust
gender_sha~k | Coefficient  std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
ATET         |
    daughter |
   (1 vs 0)  |   .0504451   .2333096     0.22   0.829    -.4068334    .5077236
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

.                 mat coef_women=r(table)

.                 scalar N_women = e(N)   

.                 
.                 scalar atet_men = el(coef_men,1,1)

.                 scalar atet_women = el(coef_women,1,1)

. 
.                 * (ii) standard error
.                 scalar se_men = el(coef_men,2,1)

.                 scalar se_women = el(coef_women,2,1)

. 
.                 * (iii) family of the test statistic (e.g. z, t, F, Chi²)
.                 local test_stat_family = "z"

. 
.                 * (iv) residual and model degrees of freedom (DFs) if applica
> ble: NOT APPLICABLE
.                 local df_residual = e(df_r)

.                 local df_model = e(df_m)

. 
.                 * (v) calculate p-value
.                 // Calculate difference in ATETs and its standard error
.                 scalar diff = atet_men - atet_women

.                 scalar se_diff = sqrt(se_women^2 + se_men^2)

. 
.                 // Calculate z-statistic and p-value
.                 scalar z = diff / se_diff

.                 scalar p = 2 * (1 - normal(abs(z)))

.                 local coefficient = diff

.                 local se = se_diff

.                 local p_value = p

. 
.                 * (vi) number of observations
.                 scalar N_total = N_men + N_women

.                 local num_obs = N_total

. 
.                 * (vii) number of participants
.                 quietly levelsof pid if e(sample), local(participants)

.                 local num_participants = `num_obs'              // can be don
> e as data is based on 1 year only

.                 
.                 * (viii) interpretation of directionality
.                 scalar coef_d_daughter = diff

.                 local interpretation "positive coefficient is in line with hy
> pothesis"

. 
.         // Display the saved statistics
.         di "Coefficient: `coefficient'"
Coefficient: -.3434853968978598

.         di "Standard Error: `se'"
Standard Error: .3678113721834618

